+     ring opened at the top right, split clockwise blue, green, yellow, red (the order Google's G
+     runs), around a dark lens. Each arc ends flat where the next colour starts; the two open ends
+     are round. The 108dp canvas keeps the mark inside the 66dp safe zone that every icon shape shows.
+     Design and the two other concepts: docs/design/launcher-icon-concepts.html. -->
